WEBVTT

01:31.456 --> 01:34.144
[Episode 28]

01:34.144 --> 01:38.383
Father, I have long fallen for Zhi Li.

01:39.463 --> 01:43.144
Zhi Li is like a precious treasure
in my heart.

01:43.144 --> 01:46.183
I cannot watch people judge her at all.

01:46.183 --> 01:49.463
I established my own household
because I want to give her the best.

01:49.463 --> 01:51.023
I know

01:51.023 --> 01:53.743
it's still not enough to prove my sincerity.

01:53.743 --> 01:58.144
So I accept any test you set for me.

02:03.584 --> 02:05.383
Nian,

02:06.303 --> 02:08.703
I watched you grow up.

02:08.703 --> 02:11.944
You have always had courage and principles.

02:11.944 --> 02:13.504
Although you are young,

02:13.504 --> 02:17.863
you have always been steady
in speech and action.

02:23.064 --> 02:27.184
But this time,

02:27.184 --> 02:29.423
I won't arrange Zhi Li's marriage.

02:29.423 --> 02:33.184
Zhi Li chooses her own husband.

02:37.024 --> 02:38.543
Zhi Li,

02:39.583 --> 02:41.624
will you marry me?

02:45.344 --> 02:49.504
With the Shen family weakened,
how could I possibly rush into marriage?

02:52.103 --> 02:55.184
Rest assured. As long as I am here,

02:55.184 --> 02:58.423
I won't let anyone
slight the Shen family again.

02:58.423 --> 03:00.224
I can ask His Majesty to decree our marriage

03:00.224 --> 03:04.064
so you can marry into the Di family
with honor and glory.

03:06.344 --> 03:08.304
Do you really not care at all

03:09.024 --> 03:11.024
about what happened to me?

03:11.024 --> 03:13.103
I don't care at all.

03:13.103 --> 03:14.863
But do you know

03:14.863 --> 03:19.224
the knot in my heart can't be undone
by a simple 'I don't care'?

03:19.224 --> 03:21.304
Even if I marry you,

03:21.304 --> 03:23.224
I will not love you.

03:23.224 --> 03:25.344
I will never force your feelings.

03:25.344 --> 03:28.383
I know my proposal today is abrupt,

03:28.383 --> 03:30.904
but I also did it to protect
the Shen family's reputation.

03:30.904 --> 03:34.624
I have no intention
of taking advantage of you.

03:34.624 --> 03:38.304
If one day your heart belongs to another,

03:39.224 --> 03:41.344
I will never stand in your way.

03:43.504 --> 03:44.703
Trust me.

03:44.703 --> 03:47.423
I will never let you suffer
any grievance or harm.

03:47.423 --> 03:49.744
Not ever in this lifetime.

03:54.983 --> 03:58.624
Zhi Li, I understand your current worries.

03:58.624 --> 04:01.744
You deserve all the goodness in this world.

04:01.744 --> 04:06.744
Whatever you decide,
your family's integrity will never falter.

04:23.424 --> 04:25.184
Nian,

04:26.703 --> 04:28.544
I trust you.

04:29.223 --> 04:31.383
I am willing to marry you.

04:42.912 --> 04:46.333
[Shen Mansion]

05:07.504 --> 05:08.944
Don't worry.

05:08.944 --> 05:12.143
We'll be here with you for the journey ahead.

05:59.624 --> 06:03.544
My lord, my lady,
everything is ready outside.

06:03.544 --> 06:05.984
- Everything is ready?
- It's ready?

06:11.583 --> 06:14.944
Lin, light the fire.

06:28.064 --> 06:30.064
It's so beautiful.

07:04.576 --> 07:06.383
[Shen Mansion]

07:06.383 --> 07:07.944
So beautiful.

07:07.944 --> 07:09.903
This one looks nice.

07:16.713 --> 07:17.783
Don't worry.

07:17.783 --> 07:21.064
Di Nian can pluck
the stars and moon for Zhi Li

07:21.064 --> 07:23.463
and also give her the freedom to roam beyond.

07:23.463 --> 07:26.104
Perhaps this is also a gift.

07:26.104 --> 07:28.703
By the time of their wedding,

07:28.703 --> 07:31.184
Fu Zhi and Mr. Shen should be back as well.

07:31.184 --> 07:33.864
Now that the Huxiao Gang
and its protective umbrella

07:33.864 --> 07:35.944
have been completely eliminated.

07:35.944 --> 07:39.944
Director Meng, I must congratulate you
on getting what you wished for.

07:39.944 --> 07:44.104
What I wished for
is also what Your Majesty had in mind.

07:44.104 --> 07:46.343
If we are to say congratulations,

07:46.343 --> 07:49.263
it should be me congratulating Your Majesty.

07:51.424 --> 07:53.383
I remember you once said

07:53.383 --> 07:55.463
that one should make a wish
on the first snow.

07:55.463 --> 07:58.104
You have achieved another great merit.

07:58.104 --> 08:00.984
Tell me what you want.

08:04.944 --> 08:07.223
Your Majesty already knows.

08:12.823 --> 08:18.223
My wish has always been
to stand in the court and serve.

08:18.223 --> 08:20.864
Is there no wish concerning me?

08:24.104 --> 08:28.944
To walk side by side
and light each other's way for a while

08:28.944 --> 08:30.424
is to live without regret.

08:30.424 --> 08:32.944
I would not make it hard for Your Majesty,

08:34.184 --> 08:36.223
nor would I be greedy.

08:36.223 --> 08:39.264
Then I shall be greedy on your behalf.

08:40.103 --> 08:44.384
I want you to have
both power and a true heart.

08:45.583 --> 08:48.784
The dragon and phoenix pendants
accompanied my parents for over thirty years.

08:48.784 --> 08:51.623
The dragon is the emperor,
and the phoenix the empress.

08:51.623 --> 08:56.144
Today, with the snow
on the West Mountain as my witness,

08:56.144 --> 08:57.944
I entrust this one to you.

08:57.944 --> 09:01.223
I know what you want
is not the position of empress.

09:01.223 --> 09:03.904
Even less to be trapped in the inner palace.

09:04.583 --> 09:07.703
But this is my promise to you.

09:07.703 --> 09:10.544
I deeply trust Your Majesty.

09:10.544 --> 09:12.544
But the ancestral precepts forbid it.

09:12.544 --> 09:18.384
I would rather be a blade
and a voice of truth

09:18.384 --> 09:20.863
so that Your Majesty
can enjoy the glory of the world.

09:20.863 --> 09:24.583
Ancestral precepts are dead,
but people are alive.

09:24.583 --> 09:27.424
I am reforming officialdom and the court

09:27.424 --> 09:29.544
because I refuse to bend to tradition.

09:29.544 --> 09:32.664
A position of power, I give you.

09:32.664 --> 09:34.784
A life without regret, I'll live it with you.

09:34.784 --> 09:38.024
These two things
have never been mutually exclusive.

09:38.024 --> 09:42.064
I am willing to share
the weight of this realm with you.

09:42.064 --> 09:44.463
I am willing to accompany Your Majesty

09:46.064 --> 09:48.184
to secure the realm,

09:48.944 --> 09:51.024
nurture the people,

09:51.904 --> 09:54.184
and achieve lasting peace.

11:05.024 --> 11:06.024
[Happiness]

11:06.024 --> 11:09.583
First bow to Heaven and Earth.

11:13.503 --> 11:17.064
Second bow to the parents.

11:24.064 --> 11:26.983
Third bow to each other.

11:36.743 --> 11:40.144
Perform the nuptial cup ceremony.

11:43.863 --> 11:46.424
Drink the nuptial wine together.

11:46.424 --> 11:50.103
May the couple live together until old age.

11:58.784 --> 12:03.703
Congratulations.

12:07.064 --> 12:08.784
Wonderful.

12:26.904 --> 12:29.664
My lady, the Marquis
has dismissed the guests.

12:29.664 --> 12:31.623
He said you are tired today

12:31.623 --> 12:33.463
and should rest in the inner chamber.

12:33.463 --> 12:35.623
He'll sleep on the couch in the outer room

12:35.623 --> 12:37.944
and will not disturb you.

13:15.064 --> 13:16.664
Zhi Li,

13:19.904 --> 13:21.264
you're still awake so late?

13:21.264 --> 13:22.904
Is there something?

13:22.904 --> 13:25.144
Now that we are married,

13:25.144 --> 13:27.024
if we sleep in separate rooms,

13:27.024 --> 13:30.184
what will the court officials say
if word of this gets out?

13:30.184 --> 13:33.304
I'd like to see who dares call this a sham.

13:33.304 --> 13:34.583
Rest assured.

13:34.583 --> 13:37.264
With me here, no one will dare to bully you.

13:37.264 --> 13:41.144
From now on, let's just be like
we were at the Shen family.

13:41.144 --> 13:43.264
You should go to bed early.

13:43.264 --> 13:46.064
You have preserved
the Shen family's reputation.

13:46.064 --> 13:50.384
I don't want to harm your reputation
because of my faults.

13:50.384 --> 13:54.264
Your authority in the military
must not be diminished in the slightest.

13:54.264 --> 13:58.264
Especially now that you have
inherited the title.

13:58.264 --> 14:00.424
Since I have married you,

14:00.424 --> 14:03.223
I will by no means
be ignorant of these matters.

14:03.223 --> 14:05.184
No matter what,

14:05.184 --> 14:07.823
I will not let you suffer any grievance.

14:11.664 --> 14:13.983
From now on,

14:15.823 --> 14:19.424
you, Di Nian,
are the husband of me, Shen Zhi Li.

14:19.424 --> 14:23.024
And the Di Mansion is my home.

14:23.024 --> 14:27.503
You treat me well,
and I will treat you well in return.

14:27.503 --> 14:30.503
Zhi Li, although we are married,

14:30.503 --> 14:32.223
I will respect you.

14:32.223 --> 14:35.743
I will wait until you truly like me.

14:38.664 --> 14:41.024
You look so beautiful when you smile.

15:31.623 --> 15:33.304
Zhi Li,

15:33.304 --> 15:36.463
you sleep here, and I'll sleep on the couch.

15:36.463 --> 15:39.703
Call me if you need anything in the night.

16:03.520 --> 16:08.064
[Censorate]

16:08.064 --> 16:09.904
Director Meng.

16:13.664 --> 16:16.343
It's windy today. Put this on.

16:16.343 --> 16:18.304
Don't catch a cold.

16:22.983 --> 16:24.304
I can do it myself.

16:24.304 --> 16:25.623
Let me.

16:25.623 --> 16:27.944
There's still much to do. Get back to work.

16:27.944 --> 16:29.503
Don't worry.

16:29.503 --> 16:32.823
I won't neglect a single task
you have entrusted to me.

16:36.032 --> 16:38.074
There.

16:38.074 --> 16:39.583
I'm off.

16:53.784 --> 16:56.784
In the third year of Jingyuan
of the Ning Empire,

16:56.784 --> 16:58.743
the imperial grand sacrifice is held.

16:58.743 --> 17:00.384
May Heaven bless us

17:00.384 --> 17:02.424
and grant favor to all the people.

17:02.424 --> 17:04.104
The sacred ancestors built the realm

17:04.104 --> 17:05.983
and handed down the precepts.

17:05.983 --> 17:08.703
[Ancestral Spirit Tablets]
His Majesty offers the ritual vessels,

17:08.703 --> 17:10.703
bows to the ancestors,

17:10.703 --> 17:12.263
and leads all officials

17:12.263 --> 17:13.904
in the sacred ceremony.

17:13.904 --> 17:17.384
We humbly offer this to the spirits.

17:29.424 --> 17:32.184
Kneel and bow.

17:36.384 --> 17:38.944
Second bow.

17:41.303 --> 17:44.023
Third bow.

18:02.904 --> 18:05.543
Today is the grand ancestral offering.

18:05.543 --> 18:07.263
With the ancestors above,

18:07.263 --> 18:11.144
I personally issue an edict of reform.

18:11.144 --> 18:15.824
The founding emperor set down twelve precepts
at the realm's dawn,

18:15.824 --> 18:17.344
which have lasted through three reigns.

18:17.344 --> 18:18.983
But times have changed.

18:18.983 --> 18:22.624
Three among those twelve:
the ban on ruler-subject love,

18:22.624 --> 18:24.223
the perpetual servitude law,

18:24.223 --> 18:26.023
and the official-nominated empress selection,

18:26.023 --> 18:29.263
are no longer suitable for the times.

18:29.263 --> 18:32.023
Taking official-nominated
empress selection for example,

18:32.023 --> 18:34.664
it was meant to balance
the ruler and the officials

18:34.664 --> 18:36.624
but was nearly exploited by evil hands

18:36.624 --> 18:38.983
and almost brought calamity.

18:38.983 --> 18:41.384
After much deliberation,

18:41.384 --> 18:45.063
any outdated precepts
that hinder the nation's strength

18:45.063 --> 18:47.584
must be completely uprooted.

18:47.584 --> 18:50.743
Your Majesty, since ancestral precepts
were established,

18:50.743 --> 18:52.584
they haven't been altered for three reigns.

18:52.584 --> 18:54.703
For Your Majesty to rashly abolish them,

18:54.703 --> 18:57.144
what does that make of the ancestors

18:57.144 --> 18:59.424
and the palace rules and rites?

18:59.424 --> 19:01.463
There is no construction without destruction.

19:01.463 --> 19:04.424
If we follow every old practice
and cling to rigid rules,

19:04.424 --> 19:07.743
that'd be to defy the ancestors' true intent.

19:07.743 --> 19:09.223
Your Majesty is wise.

19:09.223 --> 19:10.824
The remnants of Zhongwan are lurking.

19:10.824 --> 19:13.503
Reforming now
will only lead to chaos in the court.

19:13.503 --> 19:16.223
- If enemies exploit this and strike...
- Without internal worries,

19:16.223 --> 19:18.384
why fear external threats?

19:18.384 --> 19:20.463
If the court is united as one,

19:20.463 --> 19:22.063
even if surrounded by powerful enemies,

19:22.063 --> 19:25.344
what does our country have to fear?

19:25.344 --> 19:26.944
There is no need for further discussion.

19:26.944 --> 19:29.223
My decision is final.

19:49.829 --> 19:52.944
This is the phoenix pendant
the late emperor gave the late empress.

19:52.944 --> 19:54.344
It's the imperial couple's token.

19:54.344 --> 19:55.664
Your Majesty is not yet married.

19:55.664 --> 19:58.344
How did an official like you
get such an important token?

19:58.344 --> 20:02.824
Audacious Meng Ting Hui!
How dare you covet the position of empress!

20:02.824 --> 20:05.864
During the case
of the true and false Huiyuan,

20:05.864 --> 20:08.624
I suspected you had ill intentions.

20:08.624 --> 20:10.424
You claim to serve the court,

20:10.424 --> 20:12.664
but you're angling for His Majesty's favor

20:12.664 --> 20:13.944
and the empress's place.

20:13.944 --> 20:15.384
Now, thinking back carefully,

20:15.384 --> 20:18.063
she went after the Right Chancellor,
set up the Shen family,

20:18.063 --> 20:20.023
and destroyed Lady Shen's reputation

20:20.023 --> 20:22.223
all to pave her own way
to become empress, didn't she?

20:22.223 --> 20:24.063
Those words are far too biased.

20:24.063 --> 20:25.303
If not for Director Meng,

20:25.303 --> 20:27.624
would Ling Yun Fei, the Huxiao Gang,

20:27.624 --> 20:30.144
or even the treacherous Gu Qin
hiding in the court

20:30.144 --> 20:32.263
have been brought to justice so quickly?

20:32.263 --> 20:33.463
Stop changing the subject.

20:33.463 --> 20:35.063
Why is the phoenix pendant in her hands?

20:35.063 --> 20:37.584
I gave it to her.

20:42.344 --> 20:47.584
I personally gave the phoenix pendant
to Meng Ting Hui.

20:47.584 --> 20:50.144
A love between ruler and subject
is a forbidden crime.

20:50.144 --> 20:51.944
Does Your Majesty mean--

20:51.944 --> 20:53.932
That's right.

20:53.932 --> 20:56.783
I love Meng Ting Hui.

20:56.783 --> 21:00.184
I have decided
to abolish the ban on ruler-subject love.

21:00.184 --> 21:05.463
Of the three outdated precepts
Your Majesty said to abolish,

21:05.463 --> 21:09.023
I'm afraid you only want to abolish this one

21:09.703 --> 21:14.144
to elevate Meng Ting Hui
to the position of empress.

21:14.144 --> 21:17.303
An evil woman that beguiles the ruler

21:18.384 --> 21:21.824
deserves death by a thousand cuts
by ancestral precepts.

21:21.824 --> 21:24.664
Not one of the 360 articles
of the Ning Empire's law includes this crime.

21:24.664 --> 21:25.864
Your Majesty!

21:25.864 --> 21:27.584
For the so-called ancestral precepts,

21:27.584 --> 21:32.703
if they are outdated,
they should be reformed.

21:34.743 --> 21:37.624
If Your Majesty breaks
one precept for her today,

21:37.624 --> 21:40.023
tomorrow you could abolish
a hundred laws for her.

21:40.023 --> 21:42.824
If this continues, I'm afraid this court

21:42.824 --> 21:46.063
will become the autocracy
of Your Majesty and Meng Ting Hui.

21:46.063 --> 21:48.263
What need would there be
for officials like us?

21:48.263 --> 21:50.584
What wrong is there in my desire to reform?

21:50.584 --> 21:54.463
I am doing all this
not just for Meng Ting Hui alone.

21:54.463 --> 21:56.384
It is simply that her existence

21:56.384 --> 21:58.503
has made my resolve to reform even more firm

21:58.503 --> 21:59.783
and my pace even faster.

21:59.783 --> 22:03.223
Even if Your Majesty has a thousand reasons,

22:03.223 --> 22:06.023
in the eyes of the world,

22:06.023 --> 22:09.263
you are merely beguiled by this evil woman.

22:09.263 --> 22:11.584
Does Your Majesty not fear
losing the people's hearts

22:11.584 --> 22:13.584
and bearing the infamy of a fatuous ruler?

22:13.584 --> 22:15.664
It's my realm.

22:16.303 --> 22:19.184
I will shoulder it myself.

22:28.144 --> 22:30.384
[Edict of Self-Reproach]
I have issued an Edict of Self-Reproach.

22:30.384 --> 22:32.824
I will proclaim to the world

22:32.824 --> 22:35.783
that the merits and faults of my reform

22:35.783 --> 22:38.624
will be left for later generations to judge.

22:41.104 --> 22:43.664
An Edict of Self-Reproach?

22:43.664 --> 22:46.303
Your Majesty,

22:46.303 --> 22:51.063
Meng Ting Hui holds the great power
of oversight as a woman.

22:51.063 --> 22:53.904
It's already forbidden
by the ancestral precepts.

22:54.743 --> 22:57.783
Now, she and Your Majesty...

22:59.703 --> 23:02.944
It's an omen of national disaster!

23:02.944 --> 23:05.864
The late emperor bestowed
this dragon-head cane upon me

23:05.864 --> 23:08.424
to strike fatuous rulers

23:08.424 --> 23:10.944
and treacherous officials.

23:11.824 --> 23:15.344
In the presence of the ancestors,

23:15.344 --> 23:21.223
I will properly discipline Your Majesty
on behalf of the late emperor!

23:22.703 --> 23:24.664
A calamity star has descended,

23:24.664 --> 23:26.023
wreaking havoc upon the court.

23:26.023 --> 23:28.904
Today, I will rectify the court

23:28.904 --> 23:31.184
and purge the ruler's side!

23:33.703 --> 23:36.063
Lord Xu!

23:40.503 --> 23:42.543
Lord Xu,

23:42.543 --> 23:49.944
I tolerate this strike from you
because you are a veteran of three reigns.

24:19.463 --> 24:21.783
Late emperor,

24:23.384 --> 24:26.543
I have failed to complete

24:27.263 --> 24:30.503
the task you entrusted to me.

24:31.263 --> 24:34.463
But please rest assured.

24:34.463 --> 24:37.944
Even if I must die,

24:37.944 --> 24:41.983
I will not let His Majesty
continue making mistakes

24:41.983 --> 24:45.424
and bear the infamy of a fatuous ruler.

24:49.104 --> 24:52.223
Lord Xu!

24:52.983 --> 24:54.864
Lord Xu!

24:54.864 --> 24:56.063
Lord Xu!

24:56.063 --> 24:58.503
Lord Xu!

25:00.343 --> 25:02.624
Summon the imperial physician!

25:02.624 --> 25:04.664
Wait.

25:04.664 --> 25:10.104
Your Majesty, unless you repeal
the Edict of Self-Reproach

25:10.104 --> 25:12.783
and execute the evil woman,

25:12.783 --> 25:17.999
I would rather die here in this hall.

25:17.999 --> 25:21.248
Lord Xu, you cannot die.

25:21.248 --> 25:23.386
If anyone should die, it should be me.

25:23.386 --> 25:26.983
It is I who has failed the ancestors.

25:28.424 --> 25:31.983
Your Majesty, the foundation
of the Ning Empire was hard-won.

25:31.983 --> 25:33.983
Please listen to Lord Xu

25:33.983 --> 25:37.543
and withdraw the Edict of Self-Reproach.

25:39.184 --> 25:42.543
We beg Your Majesty
to withdraw the Edict of Self-Reproach.

25:42.543 --> 25:46.263
We beg Your Majesty
to withdraw the Edict of Self-Reproach.

25:47.664 --> 25:50.959
We beg Your Majesty
to withdraw the Edict of Self-Reproach

25:50.959 --> 25:53.364
and execute Meng Ting Hui.

25:53.364 --> 25:56.144
We beg Your Majesty
to withdraw the Edict of Self-Reproach

25:56.144 --> 25:59.263
and execute Meng Ting Hui.

26:03.250 --> 26:04.864
Your Majesty,

26:04.864 --> 26:06.983
I acknowledge my crime.

26:13.303 --> 26:15.703
I request to be imprisoned

26:16.503 --> 26:18.703
and await my punishment.

26:30.223 --> 26:31.730
Meng Ting Hui.

26:34.917 --> 26:36.432
I have no regrets.

26:38.384 --> 26:44.104
But if Your Majesty drives a veteran
of three reigns to death because of me,

26:44.783 --> 26:48.063
not even my death could atone for it.

26:50.063 --> 26:53.864
I hope Your Majesty
will prioritize the realm.

27:39.491 --> 27:41.714
Miss Meng, this is a medicine
for feigning death.

27:41.714 --> 27:43.543
After taking it, within twenty-four hours,

27:43.543 --> 27:45.424
your breath and pulse will completely vanish,

27:45.424 --> 27:47.503
and even the imperial physicians
can't find out.

27:49.184 --> 27:50.664
What are you doing?

27:50.664 --> 27:52.023
Saving you and getting you out.

27:52.023 --> 27:54.023
I will not leave.

27:54.023 --> 27:56.983
The officials were enraged in the court.

27:56.983 --> 27:59.584
That's why I requested imprisonment.

27:59.584 --> 28:03.783
And the gold chain's break was strange.

28:06.594 --> 28:08.743
<i>You were just momentarily beguiled,</i>

28:08.743 --> 28:10.824
and your mind was clouded.

28:10.824 --> 28:13.783
All I could do was use the soft gold fuse
to give you a push.

28:13.783 --> 28:17.104
<i>In two hours, the ancestral incense
will be burned,</i>

28:17.104 --> 28:20.303
<i>which is the perfect time
for the gold chain to break.</i>

28:22.223 --> 28:23.756
Do you regret it?

28:26.104 --> 28:30.144
Do you truly believe
he will defy the world for you?

28:33.424 --> 28:35.664
His Majesty is not doing it just for me.

28:35.664 --> 28:39.184
He wants to abolish
the ban on ruler-subject love

28:39.184 --> 28:42.144
and cleave through the Ning Empire's
outdated precepts.

28:42.144 --> 28:44.783
<i>This path is difficult.</i>

28:44.783 --> 28:46.384
<i>But we can't give up</i>

28:47.023 --> 28:49.543
<i>simply because it's difficult.</i>

28:49.543 --> 28:53.344
Your Majesty, these three ancestral precepts
were decreed by the ancestor

28:53.344 --> 28:54.904
and cannot be violated.

28:54.904 --> 28:56.303
His Majesty has great foresight

28:56.303 --> 28:57.624
and is willing to create a precedent.

28:57.624 --> 29:02.104
As his subjects,
we should respectfully comply.

29:03.543 --> 29:07.104
Look at the fine students
Grand Tutor Shen has taught,

29:07.104 --> 29:11.424
each one relying on your backing,

29:11.424 --> 29:14.584
treating the ancestral laws as child's play

29:14.584 --> 29:16.824
and indulging His Majesty's mischief.

29:16.824 --> 29:18.184
Lord Xu,

29:18.184 --> 29:19.303
rites change with the times,

29:19.303 --> 29:20.864
and laws shift with the world.

29:20.864 --> 29:23.263
Breaking the old and establishing the new
is the general trend.

29:23.263 --> 29:24.703
It requires a bold emperor,

29:24.703 --> 29:26.743
daring to be the first under heaven.

29:26.743 --> 29:28.543
Though we are old ministers,

29:28.543 --> 29:31.263
we must never be ones
who cling to the old ways.

29:31.263 --> 29:32.944
What the Grand Tutor says
is absolutely right.

29:32.944 --> 29:36.703
The words His Majesty spoke that day
were enlightening to us,

29:36.703 --> 29:39.384
and today, hearing the Grand Tutor's words

29:39.384 --> 29:42.624
further clears the clouds for us juniors

29:42.624 --> 29:44.584
and inspires us greatly.

29:44.584 --> 29:47.144
Indeed, we are willing to support His Majesty

29:47.144 --> 29:49.824
to break the old and build the new.

29:49.824 --> 29:52.783
Don't you think that in the three years
of His Majesty's rule,

29:52.783 --> 29:55.223
the court has been vibrant

29:55.223 --> 29:59.584
and Ning Empire has taken on
a completely new look?

30:04.904 --> 30:08.023
His Majesty arrives.

30:37.104 --> 30:41.503
Bring forth the Founding Emperor's Whip.

31:01.184 --> 31:05.783
Your Majesty,
the Founding Emperor's Whip is here.

31:07.624 --> 31:10.223
We need someone to execute it.

31:13.703 --> 31:15.543
Lord Xu.

31:20.184 --> 31:22.063
Grand Tutor Shen.

31:22.063 --> 31:23.824
The ancestral precepts are important.

31:23.824 --> 31:25.983
But Your Majesty is the supreme ruler,

31:25.983 --> 31:28.424
and your body concerns the state.

31:28.424 --> 31:31.263
How can it be harmed in the slightest?

31:35.703 --> 31:39.503
Chief Steward You, you do it.

31:41.344 --> 31:43.063
I dare not either.

31:43.063 --> 31:47.104
I'm willing to take the seven lashes
on behalf of Your Majesty.

31:55.743 --> 32:01.023
Chief Steward You,
you know how hard I've fought to get here.

32:03.023 --> 32:05.104
Help me this once.

32:59.864 --> 33:02.904
That lash does not count. Do it again.

33:02.904 --> 33:03.983
Your Majesty.

33:03.983 --> 33:07.983
Chief Steward You, you know how to do it.

33:07.983 --> 33:10.063
The first lash draws blood.

33:10.063 --> 33:11.944
The second lash breaks the flesh.

33:11.944 --> 33:14.344
The third lash shakes the bones.

33:18.424 --> 33:21.184
I deserve ten thousand deaths.

33:26.783 --> 33:28.783
The first lash

33:29.624 --> 33:32.503
strikes me for defying the ancestors' will

33:32.503 --> 33:34.904
and abolishing three ancestral precepts:

33:34.904 --> 33:37.223
the ban on ruler-subject love,

33:37.223 --> 33:39.144
the perpetual servitude law,

33:39.144 --> 33:41.384
and the official-nominated empress selection.

33:47.104 --> 33:49.384
The second lash

33:49.384 --> 33:51.584
strikes me for defying the will of the court

33:51.584 --> 33:54.463
and proclaiming my intent for reform.

34:01.743 --> 34:02.783
Your Majesty!

34:02.783 --> 34:05.584
Imperial Physician Li, quickly!

34:15.944 --> 34:18.183
The third lash

34:18.183 --> 34:20.864
strikes me, the ruler of this realm,

34:20.864 --> 34:23.583
for issuing an Edict of Self-Reproach

34:23.583 --> 34:27.143
and subjecting my body
to the pain of flogging

34:27.143 --> 34:30.023
to apologize to the people
of the Ning Empire.

34:30.023 --> 34:31.864
Continue.

35:18.583 --> 35:20.304
Your Majesty!

35:41.904 --> 35:43.824
<i>My decision is final.</i>

35:43.824 --> 35:46.063
<i>I'll also proclaim to all the officials</i>

35:46.063 --> 35:48.583
<i>that no matter how profound
their past seniority</i>

35:48.583 --> 35:50.344
<i>or how illustrious their merits,</i>

35:50.344 --> 35:51.944
<i>and whether it be palace rules,
ancestral precepts,</i>

35:51.944 --> 35:53.744
<i>or old state customs,</i>

35:53.744 --> 35:56.463
<i>the stability of the Ning Empire comes first.</i>

35:56.463 --> 36:01.704
<i>No one shall ever again
sway my decisions with personal gain.</i>

36:57.864 --> 37:00.623
From this day forward,

37:00.623 --> 37:02.864
the ban on ruler-subject love,

37:02.864 --> 37:04.983
the perpetual servitude law,

37:04.983 --> 37:07.583
and the official-nominated empress selection

37:07.583 --> 37:10.864
shall be forever banished
from Ning's ancestral precepts.

37:41.744 --> 37:43.867
It is time to let the morning sun

37:45.098 --> 37:49.183
shine on the new snow in front of the hall.

38:00.680 --> 38:05.304
So, it turns out it's not the court
that cannot be without me.

38:29.864 --> 38:36.183
Long live the emperor!

38:36.183 --> 38:42.744
Long live the emperor!

38:42.744 --> 38:50.103
Long live the emperor!

39:26.463 --> 39:29.583
You knelt in the snow
for a day and a night for His Majesty.

39:29.583 --> 39:31.543
You truly went all out.

39:31.543 --> 39:35.103
What if the cold causes
lasting damage to your legs?

39:36.183 --> 39:40.904
What His Majesty endured
was a thousand times heavier than mine.

39:40.904 --> 39:43.663
He shouldn't be a ruler wrongfully judged.

39:43.663 --> 39:46.103
He should be a brilliant ruler
in the annals of history.

39:46.103 --> 39:48.463
With such deep affection between you two,

39:48.463 --> 39:51.704
I believe nothing can separate you now.

39:53.231 --> 39:57.784
By the way, Fu Zhi still hasn't written back.

39:58.424 --> 40:02.133
I wonder if her father and stepmother
are making things difficult for her.

40:02.133 --> 40:04.543
Don't worry. With my brother there,

40:04.543 --> 40:06.344
Miss Yan won't be wronged.

40:06.344 --> 40:08.663
I never imagined
a carefree young master like him

40:08.663 --> 40:11.384
would settle down for one person.

40:11.384 --> 40:13.503
His Majesty is the same.

40:13.503 --> 40:17.864
Even if it means defying the whole world,
he still wants to be with you.

40:17.864 --> 40:19.784
It's quite enviable.

40:19.784 --> 40:22.824
Are things going well between you and Nian?

40:25.063 --> 40:27.384
We have lived together since childhood.

40:27.384 --> 40:31.463
Now it's just the same as it always was.

40:32.143 --> 40:36.023
Do you have even a trace
of affection for him now?

40:36.023 --> 40:38.384
If you believe he's a good man,

40:38.384 --> 40:40.944
why not give each other a chance?

40:42.663 --> 40:44.864
He is so good.

40:45.904 --> 40:49.583
I always feel that I've held him back.

40:49.583 --> 40:52.463
Meng, tell me,

40:52.463 --> 40:55.023
why did I agree to this marriage
in the first place?

40:55.023 --> 40:59.384
When a person is in extreme pain,
they always need to find support.

40:59.384 --> 41:02.744
And Nian is the lamp
that guides you forward in the fog.

41:02.744 --> 41:04.744
Because you understand each other,

41:04.744 --> 41:07.543
and he can give you
the peace of mind you need.

41:08.304 --> 41:09.983
But I do care about him.

41:09.983 --> 41:11.623
I can't stand to see him hurt.

41:11.623 --> 41:13.503
I can bear to see him sad
because of me even less.

41:13.503 --> 41:15.264
You don't need to feel guilty.

41:15.264 --> 41:18.344
I just hope you can slowly
let down your guard.

41:18.344 --> 41:20.904
Nian is worth it.

41:25.063 --> 41:27.744
Zhi Li, Director Meng.

41:30.824 --> 41:32.304
Why are you here?

41:32.304 --> 41:33.344
The patrol is over.

41:33.344 --> 41:36.704
I saw you hadn't returned yet
and was worried about you.

41:36.704 --> 41:38.384
Zhi Li,

41:40.023 --> 41:41.864
go home quickly.

41:44.344 --> 41:46.983
I bought the last steamer
of crab roe buns from West Street.

41:46.983 --> 41:49.543
They'll get cold if we don't go back soon.

41:50.944 --> 41:55.143
Also, for the gift list
for tomorrow's return visit,

41:55.143 --> 41:58.864
I added a few bolts of cloud brocade
according to Father and Mother's taste.

41:58.864 --> 42:00.503
See if it's thorough enough.

42:00.503 --> 42:03.384
It's so cold.
You shouldn't have come all this way.

42:03.384 --> 42:06.904
It's precisely because it's so cold
that I should come.

42:09.224 --> 42:11.103
I'll be going now.
